    \textbf{MA-EHGS} & $\checkmark$ & 5 & 4 & \textbf{5} & 5 & 4 & \textbf{23} \\
    Classical Greedy & $\checkmark$ & 5 & 4 & 3 & 5 & 5 & 22 \\
    HGS & $\checkmark$ & 5 & 4 & 3 & 4 & 4 & 20 \\
    Enhanced HGS & $\checkmark$ & 5 & 4 & 0 & 5 & 4 & 18 \\
    Many-Obj EA+Mutation & $\checkmark$ & 4 & 4 & 5 & 2 & 2 & 17 \\
